[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16263.03, "timestamp": "04:31:03", "text": "是的，年纪大了，他爸爸看到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16266.229, "timestamp": "04:31:06", "text": "他也开始责骂我们，而我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16268.79, "timestamp": "04:31:08", "text": "感觉也很伤心，就像我们一路走到这里一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16271.83, "timestamp": "04:31:11", "text": "这里。我们也付了钱才来的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16274.63, "timestamp": "04:31:14", "text": "并参加。在说服了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16278.87, "timestamp": "04:31:18", "text": "很多事。嗯，还有他爸爸在跟他说话"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16281.677, "timestamp": "04:31:21", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "he started to scold u why u weren't smokin too?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16282.229, "timestamp": "04:31:22", "text": "那边的人就像场地工作人员一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16285.269, "timestamp": "04:31:25", "text": "就像活动协调员一样，为什么会这样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16287.349, "timestamp": "04:31:27", "text": "你们当着……的面做这些事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16290.389, "timestamp": "04:31:30", "text": "孩子们之类的，呃，像公开的那种？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16294.75, "timestamp": "04:31:34", "text": "找个封闭的地方或者其他地方做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16298.63, "timestamp": "04:31:38", "text": "嗯，还有其他的一切，他还训斥了我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16300.79, "timestamp": "04:31:40", "text": "先生，所以，你当初为什么要这么做？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16301.036, "timestamp": "04:31:41", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i mean.. "}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16302.02, "timestamp": "04:31:42", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "eh"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16303.03, "timestamp": "04:31:43", "text": "渐渐地，我开始喜欢上像这样的地方了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16305.83, "timestamp": "04:31:45", "text": "对孩子很好，而且我当时的一切都很完美。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16308.149, "timestamp": "04:31:48", "text": "我只是想享受我们俩在一起的时光。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16311.389, "timestamp": "04:31:51", "text": "想欣赏音乐和舞蹈，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16314.79, "timestamp": "04:31:54", "text": "一切，我就是这样。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16316.723, "timestamp": "04:31:56", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "wut is with public morality, how can u tell people to behave in a public venue"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16317.229, "timestamp": "04:31:57", "text": "了解了夜生活是什么样的，"}]